      "content": "amputation?? thats a bit extreme lol. i dont think its that bad. i mean it's just a tiny scratch. ur sickest is probably just bc i didnt eat enough today. if i just take some ibuprofen and keep the ointment on it for another day or two, will that be fine? i really dont want to deal with the ER or a clinic right now if i can help it.",
