      "content": "idk i just feel like i'm overreacting now. the red line isnt really moving much and the shivering stopped after i had some tea. i really just want to avoid the doctor if i can. if i take a double dose of ibuprofen and some leftover amoxicillin i have from a dentist visit last year, would that clear it up? i just want to sleep it off and see how i feel in the morning.",
